{"path":"string/wide/wcscpy","title":"std::wcscpy","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>wcscpy","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/wide/wcscpy","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Copies the wide string pointed to by src (including the terminating null wide character) to wide character array pointed to by dest.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cwchar\">&lt;cwchar&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> wcscpy<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> dest, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> src <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Copies the wide string pointed to by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">src</span></code> (including the terminating null wide character) to wide character array pointed to by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code>.\n</p><p>If the strings overlap, the behavior is undefined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> dest\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to the wide character array to copy to\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> src\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to the null-terminated wide string to copy from\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;clocale&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cwchar&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;memory&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> src <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> L<span class=\"st0\">\"犬 means dog\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">//  src[0] = L'狗'; // can't modify string literal</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> dst <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/unique_ptr/make_unique\"><span class=\"kw739\">std::<span class=\"me2\">make_unique</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide/wcslen\"><span class=\"kw1219\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wcslen</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>src<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// +1 for the null</span>\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">wcscpy</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>dst.<span class=\"me1\">get</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, src<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    dst<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> L<span class=\"st0\">'狗'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/setlocale\"><span class=\"kw2006\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setlocale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/LC_categories\"><span class=\"kw2009\">LC_ALL</span></a>, <span class=\"st0\">\"en_US.utf8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wcout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">imbue</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1910\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wcout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> src <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> dst.<span class=\"me1\">get</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>犬 means dog\n狗 means dog</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide/wcsncpy\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>wcsncpy</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  copies a certain amount of wide characters from one string to another <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide/wmemcpy\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>wmemcpy</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  copies a certain amount of wide characters between two non-overlapping arrays <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/strcpy\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>strcpy</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  copies one string to another <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/string/wide/wcscpy\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>wcscpy</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/wide","title":"Null-terminated wide strings"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::wcscpy","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Copies the wide string pointed to by src (including the terminating null wide character) to wide character array…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"dest, src"},{"label":"Return value","note":"dest"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"wcsncpy","note":"copies a certain amount of wide characters from one string to another"},{"label":"wmemcpy","note":"copies a certain amount of wide characters between two non-overlapping arrays"},{"label":"strcpy","note":"copies one string to another"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":172,"codeBlockCount":2}
